# Telos, the Ithorians saved (TSL, 204TEL, 203TEL, 201TEL): Chodo's Mission
# 4: on the way to the docks Moza calls for help, Czerka's mercenaries in
# the compound fought room by room, Moza in the vivarium (his key; no
# reward asked: LSP), Chodo freed in his office; then Bay Two's Ithorian
# shuttle to the planet. Starts from the Czerka files' checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_rescue data/routes/tsl/telos_rescue.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Working for the Ithorians", Mission #4
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit to_203TEL       # out towards the docks
module 203tel
to tr_moza_czerka@2  # Moza calls: Czerka's mercenaries in the compound
talk
save telos_moza_call
exit to_204TEL       # back to the compound: the mercenaries and droids
module 204tel        # fought room by room
fight 30
use Door_Ith_01
fight 30
use 203_Moza         # Moza in the vivarium: his key to Chodo's office
talk
save telos_chodo_office
to -26.5,-25.0       # off Moza's smuggled plant (his talk can leave the player
                     # standing in its footprint, an island of the nav mesh)
to Chodo_M_Return    # Chodo's office, opened with Moza's key: the
talk                 # mercenaries holding him take us lightly, fought
fight 30
talk                 # Chodo and Moza; his thanks (no reward asked: LSP)
save telos_shuttle
say Transit to another module # the terminal's transit to the docks, Bay
say Dock Module 126  # Two's Ithorian: Chodo's shuttle to RZ-0031
use info_term
talk
module 201tel
say I'm to take an orbital shuttle
use 201_ith_door
talk
say Open access hallway door # the airlock's console still reads the bay as
use TermAirlock2     # open (we left it by B-4D4's walk out): pressed once
talk                 # to set it right, then the bay opened, and aboard
say Open Bay 2 door
use TermAirlock2
talk
to tr_shuttle_1      # the Ithorian shuttle: Grenn and Admiral Onasi on
talk                 # the comm before we leave (the Republic waits and sees)
module 231tel        # down to the Restoration Zone (shot down: Bao-Dur)
save telos_planet
